Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:12.62,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:41.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你会为此下地狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:08.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（疏散区）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:24:02.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦应急管理局）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.79,0:41:23.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请依法系好安全带）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好你当时不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was good you weren't here for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hanging in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把十字架也拆了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna take the cross, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们需要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想去亚特兰大 但我接受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to go to Atlanta, but I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你留下来 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you stay. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠卡萝尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe it to Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都欠卡萝尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all owe Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠她的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我经历过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 他会希望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, he would have wanted…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是来检查她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just checking on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不知道我们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got no clue we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对GREATM是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great news for GREATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,GREATM的一个坏消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In less great news for GREATM,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分完了最后一点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just scraped the bottom of the water barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,GREATM是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is… what's GREATM?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 小组名字 团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us. Group name. Solidarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Band of brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,GREATM（每个人名的首字母）\N{\fnArial\fs30}GREATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算在我的指关节弄个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about getting a tattoo on my knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是想分分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I'm just trying to think of something else, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该送他去教堂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we get him to the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动他可能让他情况更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving him could make him worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么会让他好转？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will make him better?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:06:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he doesn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一整天都没喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't had anything to drink all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我六岁的侄子都不这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, my six- year-old nephew didn't pull this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 别惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me! - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 不然我崩了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down or I'll put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 接下来该做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's next on the agenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落时分 我们朝天空开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}At sundown we fire a shot into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,引两个人出来巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get two of them out on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then once it's dark enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,房顶上的人看不见我们时 就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the rooftop spotter won't see us, we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一侧楼梯的锁破坏掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cut the locks on one of the stairways,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上到五楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开门 达里尔干掉守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I open the door, Daryl takes the guard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么干掉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刀封喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slits his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次行动必须安静 占据优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all about us doing this quiet, keeping the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.47,0:08:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼后分开行动 使用刀具和消音武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}From there, we fan out. Knives and silenced weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度一定要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西 萨莎 干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese, Sasha, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 厨房里的人交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, you take care of whoever is in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们识相 剩下的人就会投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they're smart, the rest of them will give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是5对3了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it'll be five on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:08:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给贝丝一把武器 就是6对3了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six on three once we get a weapon to Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是12对3 病人们会帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 on three. The wards will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最好的打算 那最差的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's best case. What's worst case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有一个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it takes is one of those cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在错误的时间下了楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}going down the hall at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就没法安静了 全员火并\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's not quiet. All hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得真枪实弹硬来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking about a lot of bullets flying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也只能硬来了 - 不见得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If that's what it takes. - It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get a couple of her cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,活捉她的手下 就可以跟他们换人\N{\fnArial\fs30}alive out here, we do an even trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的人换我们的人 大家各回各家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theirs for ours. Everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那招说不定管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这招一定管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那招也管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, that'll work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说道恩只是想让一切正常运转吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say this Dawn, she's just trying to keep it together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,理想和现实是两码事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying and doing are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓走她的两名警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take two of her cops away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还能有什么能耐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what choices does she have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都会各回各家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学会自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to learn how to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自卫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defend myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都说会离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是骗子 杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were liars and murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也是 - 我们那是自保\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like us. - We protected ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的教堂能撑这么久是运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky your church has lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今你不能在一个地方久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stay in one place anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能待太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once you're out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会遇到无可避免的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna find trouble you can't hide from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须学会如何战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但握法不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not holding it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须能捅下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be able to drive it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有时候它们的头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because sometimes their skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点硬 你必须能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't as soft and you need to be able…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得躺一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we are doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉卡瑞现在还在开着车找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licari is out in the sedan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有诺亚的踪迹 我们会找到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is a sign of Noah, we are going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:12:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说过 你的计划是指望着他自己遇险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just told me that your plan was counting on him screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为警察 你办事还真是靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some active police work right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, actually, there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在二号诊室的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The patient in exam room two,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她带回来的时候 她已经半死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was half dead when I brought her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的情况不太乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not looking so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是竹篮打水的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't Pin the Tail On the Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真要在这个女人身上浪费资源吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we really gonna keep wasting valuable resources on this lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的DVD要用多少电？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much electricity does your DVD take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 我们的资源很有限\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - We have very limited resources here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你每天都给它充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}You charge it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吗？ - 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you kidding me? - Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个女人才来这里一天 - 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That woman has been here one day. - Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这地方连救人也做不到 它还有什么好呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good is this place if it doesn't try to save people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn off the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉爱德华兹不用再检查那个病人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Edwards to take the patient off of his rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她自己挺过来了 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she pulls through on her own, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你说得对 她不值得再付出资源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're right. She's not worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你害死了那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just killed that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我敢站在你一边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think I have to side with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说 你改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him. Tell him you changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我的统治有多脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how fragile this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以必须由你来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll just have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去救那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna save that woman's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是药物储藏室的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is to the drug locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不放心交给爱德华兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even trust Edwards with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夏普德 我在屋顶站岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Shepherd. I'm on roof detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,北东北方向一英里处传来了枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just heard a gunshot maybe a mile north- northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫上拉姆森 开辆车去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Lamson, take a car and track it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前以为你很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你用实际行动证明了我是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've proved me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,路前面的西南方有条小溪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a creek up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里只有几英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few miles southwest of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都去吧 我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all go. I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动 伙计们 别起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay here, guys. Don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿没什么可给你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing for you in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not not not not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们都有自己的应对方法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I get that we're all dealing with things in different ways…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 华盛顿泡汤了 我不知该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I don't know what to do without DC anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并没有应对什么 我已经走出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not dealing with it. I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望他一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want him to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金不够强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene wasn't strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度不够快 连武器都不会用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't fast. He doesn't know how to use a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相是残酷的 但他确实是个没用的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth hurts, but he's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拥有一项得以保命的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had one skill that kept him living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他加以利用 我们就该生他的气吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we supposed to be mad at him 'cause he used it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太他妈对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不只你一个人失去了重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who lost something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切不可能变得比现在更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna get any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在二号诊室的那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman in exam room two,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会给她用什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what medicine would you give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩下令停止治疗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但如果可以 你会用什么药？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but if you could, what would you give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她遭遇了车祸 受了内伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in a car accident. She suffered internal injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能大概猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a guessing game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你偷来的 还是她给你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take it or did she give it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果钥匙是她给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if she gave it to you, she did not do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.55,0:18:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她绝对没安好心 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- out of the kindness of her heart. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我用什么药就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那样做是想保命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然不知道是否保住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still wondering if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肾上腺素滴注 五毫克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epinephrine drip, five milligrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会马上醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't wake up right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这会缓解她的血压\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it'll ease her blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样她就有生存的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she'll have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得上游的水会清澈一些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's any clearer upstream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在两分钟内就做好了一个滤水器啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you just built a water filter in about two minutes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这需要一些时间 但水会清澈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a while, but it'll be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们可以烧水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can boil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾变之前 你和亚伯拉罕在一起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you with Abraham before it all happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我跟别人在一起 努力生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was with other people just trying to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么到一起的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you wind up together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在达拉斯遇上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We crossed paths in Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的团队在击退行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my group, we were fighting off some dead ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开着大卡车 不知道从哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he jumped in from out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that big truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿那辆卡车安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金在驾驶室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had Eugene in the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后 他告诉我 他在拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And afterwards, he told me that he was trying to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到了我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that he saw what I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wanted my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从灾变之后 他是第一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the first person to ask me for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求我帮助的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}since this all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他也在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was lying, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些波纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those ripples.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪声是从那边传出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots were from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下 诺亚 - 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it down, Noah. - Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得太紧了就告诉我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me know if it's too tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你很聪明 诺亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were smart, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们听不到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we wouldn't hear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你射击的行尸呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are those rotters you were shooting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都可以帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我们说的做 我们就不伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what we say, we don't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在转过身去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放在地上 然后跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns on the floor and kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.39,0:22:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你们需要的话 这儿有水和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's water if you need some and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我问你一件事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话的方式…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you talk…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你举手投足之间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you carry yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.99,0:22:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前是警察吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信由你 我以前也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not, I was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是拉姆森\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Lamson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会支持我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be down for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of the good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个 我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.69,0:25:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.69,0:25:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.53,0:25:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人总比两个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}three is better than two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的朋友 他叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend, what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.13,0:26:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的计划会害死我和我朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plan is going to get me and my friends killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.99,0:26:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你得有别的警察来交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would work if you had different cops to trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.81,0:26:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩把格拉迪医院管得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn's running Grady into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.89,0:26:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中有一些人想让她下台 她自己也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of us want her out and she knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.15,0:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定她也知道我们想让拉姆森来取代她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure she knows we want Lamson to replace her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩不知道这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.51,0:26:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们的交易很可能失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's a good chance you can't make this deal work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.88,0:26:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让我们全部送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that'll leave us all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.63,0:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如你让我们走的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you let us go,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.57,0:26:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会自己解决了道恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll take care of Dawn ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们会放走你的朋友们 这事就结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll let your friends go and this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.34,0:26:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想死吗？ - 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to die? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.88,0:26:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要你马上闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to shut up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.11,0:26:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们得先和她通上话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've got to be able to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.96,0:27:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺亚告诉了我们关于她的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah told us all about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.39,0:27:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识她八年了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've known her for eight years, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.35,0:27:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想和平解决此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my only interest is peaceful resolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}not dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.09,0:27:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚睡在我自己的床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sleeping in my bed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.43,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.37,0:27:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮你们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.04,0:27:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想听听这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.50,0:28:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样 塔拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how are we doing over there, Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错 你们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty damn good. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.17,0:28:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个十字螺丝刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}A screwdriver. Phillips head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell, yes. - It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.77,0:28:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么洗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to clean these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.07,0:28:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to clean these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我们需要这项能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, we're gonna need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们最后去哪里 你加入吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever we all wind up. You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:28:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.62,0:29:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.98,0:29:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,包里的东西肯定会让你们大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never believe what's in this bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.96,0:29:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说自己不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said you weren't feeling good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.72,0:29:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.64,0:29:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我只是休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was just resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你没经历过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all this is new to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.22,0:29:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让你知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做的事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things that we do…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.88,0:29:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.75,0:29:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拿了砍刀 你还想让我怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already took the machete. What more do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想让你怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.17,0:29:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.29,0:29:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.36,0:30:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.02,0:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喘不了… - 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't… I can't… - You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喘不上气了 - 快去叫爱德华兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't breathe. - Get Edwards now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去取张轮床 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, get a gurney. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me. - Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.07,0:31:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放松 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.85,0:31:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道怎么回事 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that was. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.63,0:32:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.15,0:32:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.33,0:32:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想告诉你我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to know that I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.11,0:33:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说出来 你好好听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say it and you're gonna listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你准备好了 就让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, when you're ready, you let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他道别过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to say good- bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.93,0:33:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到了 也感受到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw it. He felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想纠结哪点都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you hold onto whatever you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得你应该铭记这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think you should hold onto that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.47,0:33:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本应该自己下手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have been able to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.45,0:33:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你让自己去感受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you let yourself feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.89,0:33:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛直面了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.81,0:33:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我帮你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.91,0:35:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说她不做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll tell you she won't make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.55,0:35:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说她绝不妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll tell you she won't compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.41,0:35:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.82,0:35:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 知己知彼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… just know who you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.23,0:35:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大概十分钟后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably heading out in the next 10 minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走之前你需要什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you need before we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点水就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, water would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.96,0:35:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 拉姆森警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Sergeant Lamson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.78,0:35:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依然是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.64,0:35:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.31,0:36:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真的警察都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the real ones are all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.37,0:37:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.56,0:37:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.66,0:37:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.08,0:37:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车场里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The parking lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.80,0:37:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我们回这儿的时候 我看见一只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were bringing us back up here I… I saw a rotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到其中一只行尸 我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw one of the rotters and I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.95,0:37:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫泰勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name was Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.48,0:37:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在格拉迪见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him at Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.20,0:37:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是在灾变后被派到那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were both sent there when shit started going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:38:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整两天才疏散完所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took two whole days to evacuate everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.17,0:38:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有睡觉 没有吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't sleep. We didn't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.32,0:38:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那依然是我这辈子最美好的两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, it was the two best days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把最后一车幸存者载到安全区\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last van of survivors to the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.98,0:38:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,道恩没让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Dawn pulled me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.21,0:38:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想要她真正信任的人开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted someone she could really trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.74,0:38:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她派了泰勒去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she put Tyler on it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人都将疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}These… these people were gonna all be evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.70,0:38:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was really pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚在外面看到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身溶化 黏在柏油路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck out there, melted to the asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我能想到的只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I could think was,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那本该是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That would have been me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.25,0:38:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本该是我 他救了我的命「\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been me. He saved my life."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么久以来 他一直在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been out there the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.81,0:38:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了街道的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he's a part of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.55,0:38:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像某种荒谬的 永无止境的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some screwed up, endless joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.79,0:38:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我对此无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's nothing I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.21,0:39:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得他在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember where he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 我可以带你去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I… I can take you right to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.85,0:39:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不出去了 但我枪法不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going out there, but I'm a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.17,0:39:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.06,0:39:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大楼南面\N{\fnArial\fs30}South side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.67,0:39:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里能看到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see him from in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.00,0:39:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.70,0:39:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说自己不渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才想让我开枪杀了你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you want me to shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.61,0:40:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.14,0:40:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell… hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.74,0:40:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.99,0:40:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在原地 不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there. Don't try to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.14,0:40:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 我又想了想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the more I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.85,0:40:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许那并不是完全\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it wasn't completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.86,0:41:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}not not not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.51,0:41:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.47,0:41:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在轿车右边20码处\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 20 yards right of the sedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有半面墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a half wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就靠在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaning against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.61,0:42:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.27,0:42:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure that's him?
